=== a two-line prompt: only its last line is redrawn
[a][b] @0:3
user@host ~\r\n
$ \r\e[J$ a\r\e[3C\r\e[J$ ab\r\e[4C\r\e[J$ ab\r\e[3C
=== a three-line prompt
[x][] @0:3
one\r\n
two\r\n
> \r\e[J> x\r\e[3C
=== \[ \] around a window-title OSC and colours take no cells
[abc][] @0:5
[abc][] @0:10
=== escape sequences and a bell take none even without \[ \]
[abc][] @0:5
[abc][] @0:10
[abc][] @0:5
=== a newline inside \[ \] does not start a line
[a][] @0:3
=== a long last line wraps, and the cursor follows
[x][] @1:5
abcdefghijkl$ \e[1A\r\e[Jabcdefghijkl$ x\r\e[5C
[x][] @1:1
[x][] @1:1
top\r\n
abcdefghij\r\e[Jabcdefghijx\r\e[1C
